<title>BELGIUM: EU says intvn grain stocks rise to 1.69 mln T.</title>
<headline>EU says intvn grain stocks rise to 1.69 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union intervention grain stocks rose to 1.69 million tonnes, from 1.43 million on May 23, European Commission figures showed on Friday.</p>
</text>
